Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:44:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add price-change history and report; fix sales report day
 range

- Migration 0003: product_price_changes, filled by a trigger whenever a
  product's cost or price changes (edit pane, bulk edit, import)
- Reports > Price changes: before/after cost and price, current margin,
  flags "cost went up but the price didn't" with a same-margin suggestion,
  and products now selling at or below cost
- Sales report used bare timestamps (read as UTC), so each "day" was
  shifted 8 hours; it now uses Manila day boundaries
- Reset script also drops the objects added by 0002/0003

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
